   "Surface keywords map to reversible canonical Romenagri ASCII-7 identifiers (C-identifier-legal).",
   "Native .uhin -> hincc -> Romenagri identifiers -> UNMODIFIED GCC/LLVM; debuggers/SCM/IDEs/libs untouched.",
   "Adaptation cost of the linguistic layer across any future execution paradigm = 0."
  ],
  "standard_register_process": [
   "1. IDIOLECT \u2014 an individual publishes a CSV; langspec_gen yields a personal standard + verified C.",
   "2. COMMUNITY REGISTER \u2014 a language community converges on a shared CSV; conflicts are reviewed by speakers.",
   "3. CANONICALISATION \u2014 the construct->keyword table is frozen and versioned in langspec/output/.",
   "4. STANDARDS-BODY ADOPTION \u2014 the frozen register is submitted to Unicode UTC / W3C i18n / ISO-IEC JTC1 / IEEE SA as a localization of an existing standard (not a new language).",
   "5. The kernel and toolchain never change at any step \u2014 only registry rows are added."
  ],
